R-CH10 R-TF8 (slice 238, Design Q613 item 8): `tln tool update talon` reads config.toml leniently. A channel table with an unknown shape word gives the warning `<path>:<line>: channels.reify.shape: 'git-build' is not a channel shape (ignored)` and the table is ignored. No stop: the update goes on, exit 0. The text is a proposal (TW24), in the form of the lenient warnings of slice 231. The talon.toml of the directory of the run is the one of gate/tf10-update-talon (a range that this tln is outside of): it is not read.
